    "text": "WEBVTT\n\n\n00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.740\nHello, I just got a new bag.\n\n00:00:03.741 --> 00:00:06.381\nNormally I don't really get bags cause I don't know,\n\n00:00:06.382 --> 00:00:07.821\nI just never really used one.\n\n00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:10.461\nSo I actually not just got one,\n\n00:00:10.462 --> 00:00:13.401\nbut I got 2. This is the first one.\n\n00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.560\nI actually did it into the door\n\n00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.200\nsadly.\n\n00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.040\nLet's open it.\n\n00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.560\nI've no idea. Ooh,\n\n00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.320\nI've no idea how I'm gonna open this box.\n\n00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:29.620\nOoh,\n\n00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.560\nthis is the burger burger.\n\n00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.680\nI guess I just liked it cause it was black.\n\n00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.740\nOoh,\n\n00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.400\nI just ripped it.\n\n00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:46.960\nMy bad,\n\n00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.560\nmy bad. I forgot I got the fondant car.\n\n00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.280\nNow we have\n\n00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.760\nthis is the bag.\n\n00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.800\nYay.\n\n00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.600\nOoh,\n\n00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:04.860\nI don't know if I should look.\n\n00:01:04.861 --> 00:01:08.201\nShould I look or should I pull it out and then look?\n\n00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.200\nI'm like a lucky dude.\n\n00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:15.500\nYeah, I'm gonna pull it out and look.\n\n00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:17.961\nThere's like a whole lot of something in there.\n\n00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:37.760\nWhat's the thing that I'm going to take out?\n\n00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.600\nOh my God, it's so cute.\n\n00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.720\nLook at the cute little bow.\n\n00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.720\nCute,\n\n00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.420\npretty,\n\n00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:54.980\npretty.\n\n00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.440\nI like how big it is. And this pattern,\n\n00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.540\nI don't know if you can see it,\n\n00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:07.801\nbut pretty cute. This is my bigger bag.\n\n00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.900\nOkay, onto the next. Okay,\n\n00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:15.641\nwe are going to open second bag and it's from Mumu and it's round two.\n\n00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.140\nI wanted to get it on my birthday,\n\n00:02:18.141 --> 00:02:21.981\nbut they literally ran out like the day like I wanted to order it,\n\n00:02:21.982 --> 00:02:25.561\nwhich is cause I was really looking at it the whole week.\n\n00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.640\nSo this. Is from France.\n\n00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.460\nÆ elsker\n\n00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:40.300\nåh kan du ikke si til meg.\n\n00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.060\nOkay,\n\n00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.640\nlet's see. Let's see.\n\n00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.960\nOh, it's so cute.\n\n00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.080\nLet me see all the packaging out\n\n00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.240\nand the packaging. So in there,\n\n00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.440\nI'll show you\n\n00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:10.880\nin the instructions.\n\n00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.100\n파이팅 키치 키치 키치\n\n00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.800\nhere you go these are my bags for today\n\n00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.260\nI'll see if I get any more but I think I like these one now\n"
